  "definition": "Experience Requirements",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-11-24",
  "historyNote": "#5222, eff 9-11-91; EXPIRED 9-11-97 New. #6597, INTERIM, eff 10-8-97, EXPIRED: 2-5-98 New. #6876, eff 10-28-98; amd by #7575, eff 10-13-01; ss by #8710, eff 8-25-06; ss by #10544, eff 3-13-14; ss by #14085, eff 11-24-24",
